            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Macbrow 1.5.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>Closed notch accent: a touch of colour around the closed notch so you can tell where Macbrow lives. Choose Edge, Lip, Halo or Handle in Settings &gt; Appearance &gt; Closed notch, with its colour, intensity and motion. It is off by default.</li>
<li>It follows the artwork or the time of day, stays still with Reduce Motion or in Low Power Mode, and hides in full-screen apps.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
