        <item>
            <title>1.4.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 10:14:59 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Macbrow 1.4.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>Panel size: make the open notch smaller. Choose Normal, Compact or Minimal in Settings &gt; Appearance. The change applies at once.</li>
<li>Every screen: show Macbrow on all your connected displays, only on the main one, or automatically on the one with the notch. Choose in Settings &gt; Opening. Screens without a notch get a pill in the menu bar.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
