            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Macbrow 1.1.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>Audio output picker: a new button next to the volume slider lists your outputs (speakers, AirPods, displays, AirPlay) and switches between them.</li>
<li>Macbrow now speaks English, Spanish, French, German, Portuguese and Italian. Choose the language in Settings, or let it follow your system.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
